message: "If you use this software, its models, or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "SNBR TMS App: Transcranial Magnetic Stimulation Data Parser and Report Generator"
abstract: >-
  A Windows desktop application for the ALS Neurophysiology and Neuromodulation Lab
  that parses transcranial magnetic stimulation (TMS) measurement files (.MEM) produced
  by Qtrack sessions, extracts TMS metrics (such as resting motor threshold, short-interval
  intracortical inhibition, and cortical silent period), builds analysis-ready dataframes,
  and generates PDF reports that benchmark participants against healthy-control and ALS
  reference groups. Runs fully offline.
type: software
